WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.231 --> 00:00:14.131
Open your eyes... 

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:19.697
Open your eyes.

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:22.496
Wake up Link...

00:00:26.029 --> 00:00:27.162
Link... 

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:31.761
You are our final hope.

00:00:36.293 --> 00:00:38.826
The Great Calamity was merciless...

00:00:38.826 --> 00:00:41.926
It devastated everything in its path,

00:00:41.926 --> 00:00:43.259
a century ago.

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:47.491
However...

00:00:47.824 --> 00:00:49.691
The princess survived...

00:00:51.524 --> 00:00:53.423
You must save her,

00:00:53.423 --> 00:00:54.223
my daughter!

00:00:57.735 --> 00:00:58.989
Link...

00:01:01.313 --> 00:01:03.313
You are the light,

00:01:04.635 --> 00:01:07.654
that must shine upon Hyrule once again.

00:01:17.631 --> 00:01:18.785
Now go.

00:03:30.233 --> 00:03:31.825
Link...

00:03:32.992 --> 00:03:35.791
You are our final hope.

00:03:36.841 --> 00:03:40.657
The fate of Hyrule rests with you!

00:06:27.224 --> 00:06:28.723
Link...

00:06:28.723 --> 00:06:30.256
Link!

00:06:31.105 --> 00:06:34.156
My daughter's power will soon be exhausted.

00:06:34.811 --> 00:06:36.622
Once that happens,

00:06:36.622 --> 00:06:39.021
this world will face it's end,

00:06:39.021 --> 00:06:42.321
and nothing will stop him from consuming our land.

00:06:43.987 --> 00:06:46.286
You must hurry Link,

00:06:53.347 --> 00:06:56.484
I trust that you understand your duty...

00:06:59.411 --> 00:07:00.884
protect her,

00:07:00.884 --> 00:07:02.535
my daughter.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:40.309
Considering that I could not save my own Kingdom

00:07:40.546 --> 00:07:41.176
Link!

00:07:41.462 --> 00:07:43.462
I have no right to ask this of you,

00:07:46.072 --> 00:07:48.072
but I am powerless here.

00:07:49.229 --> 00:07:51.229
You must save her...

00:07:51.923 --> 00:07:53.573
my daughter.

00:07:53.573 --> 00:07:56.406
and do whatever it takes to annihilate Ganon.

00:08:51.782 --> 00:08:53.782
The Master Sword...

00:08:53.782 --> 00:08:55.527
I heard it speak to me.

00:09:03.822 --> 00:09:05.822
Your master will come for you.

00:09:07.456 --> 00:09:09.191
Until then,

00:09:09.999 --> 00:09:11.999
you shall rest safely here.

